contribute to it. It is not open source. Except for what this licence expressly allows, no rights are granted.

1. WHAT YOU MAY DO
   a. View and read the source code, documentation and assets in the official repository
      (https://github.com/aaqidmasoodi/flightout).
   b. Fork the repository on GitHub, and download, build and run the Software on your own computer, only to prepare
      and test a contribution (an issue, a bug report or a pull request) to the official repository.
   c. Download, install and play the official releases of FlightOut published by Yembera, including hosting a
      server with an official release, under the end user licence that comes with them.

