   b. distribute, publish, sublicense, sell or make available the Software or any part of it, modified or not,
      including builds made from this source, other than an unmodified fork on GitHub kept for contributing;
   c. create or distribute derivative works, ports, mods or competing products based on the Software;
   d. use the Software or any part of it to train, fine-tune or evaluate machine-learning models, or include it in
      datasets;
   e. remove or alter copyright, licence or attribution notices;
   f. use the FlightOut or Yembera names, logos or branding.

